    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Rates of tobacco use are rapidly rising in Pakistan and other low-income South Asian countries, especially amongst the youth. Since most adolescents use tobacco in presence of peers, anti-tobacco messages communicated through peers and youth icons are likely to have a positive impact on curbing the rising tide of tobacco use.",
